{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他舍不得松手，连承认失望都像是在推翻那一步。\",\n      \"key\": \"推翻那一步\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"text\": \"想到那种不必防备的亲近，他心里会软，可又怕自己一软下来就停了步。\",\n      \"key\": \"心里会软\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他把难受和想停都当成自己还不够坚定，便逼自己继续撑。\",\n      \"key\": \"不够坚定\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他给自己立了条硬规矩，累了也得撑，后来才看见自己正逼着一个累了的人硬撑。\",\n      \"key\": \"累了也得撑\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他有些茫然，撑着的劲松了，却没因此安心，才肯承认自己舍不得那种不必防备的生活。\",\n      \"key\": \"不必防备的生活\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R18\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把‘怕失望说明变心’改成承认失望就像推翻那一步。那一步为何重要由S04-1提供理由，不在正文重复；行动仍不足以让他安心，则由S04-4指回。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R19\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"去重并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"删去重复的‘怕辜负最初决意’，这层担心已在S05-1。保留独立的心理机制：他把难受和想停误认成不够坚定，因此继续逼自己。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R20\", \"R21\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"保留要求逐渐不容脆弱、直到看见自己逼一个累了的人硬撑的变化。用‘累了也得撑’写出硬规矩，删去重复的坚定与坚强说法。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R22\", \"R23\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-2\", \"S05-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"分清并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"把压力下想到亲近会心软、又怕停步，与催逼松开后仍不安、才肯承认不舍分开写。前者补足B1的柔软与克制，后者保留通往S06的转向，将抽象的‘还有舍不得的东西’具体为不必防备的生活。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3d8ae2a0-a883-457b-927d-8737362a2492", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T190530565669Z", "elapsed_seconds": 398.282, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T19:12:08.858296+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bb1a525f12bad0c1ef05325296a1a0d4d9f99f95d35ecb86370e6481d3fea5d1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridg